    "message": "ci(release): give the auto-generated brew PR a conventional title\n\npr-title.yml runs action-semantic-pull-request against a fixed type list —\nfeat, fix, docs, refactor, test, ci, build, perf, chore, revert. The release\nworkflow opened its formula PR as \"brew: update formula for vX\", so the\nConventional title check failed the moment the PR appeared, on every release.\n\nIt is not one of the ruleset's required checks, so the PR stayed mergeable and\nthe failure read as background noise rather than something with a cause. #367\nis the current instance.\n\nscripts/release.sh prints the same string as a copy-paste instruction for the\nmanual path, so it drifts the same way; fixed alongside.",
